(name *) anteroom
(room *)
(look *) TBD
(from * go #north to #kitchen)
(from * go #south to #housestreet)

#housestreet
(name *) Main Street
(room *)
(look *) you stand in fromt of your house. You prefer to walk rather than take the horse carridge.
(from * go #north to #anteroom)
(from * go #east to #canteenstreet)

#canteenstreet
(name *) Main Street
(room *)
(look *) you stand in fromt of the canteen
(from * go #east to #runstreet)
(from * go #west to #housestreet)
(from * go #north to #canteen)

#canteenfacade
(name *) canteen
(descr *) The inn is next to the university where you inhabit the Lehrstool for the Philosophy of Music.
(* is #in #canteenstreet)

#canteen
(name *) canteen
(room *)
(look *) No chicken sold!
(from * go #south to #canteenstreet)

#runstreet
(name *) Main Street
(room *)
(look *) Runstreet runs to north and south
(from * go #east to #unistreet)
(from * go #west to #canteenstreet)

#unistreet
(name *) Main Street
(room *)
(look *) you stand in front of the university
(from * go #west to #canteenstreet)
(from * go #north to #uni)

#grill
(name *) Stand
(appearance *)		The stand is selling grilled chicken
(* is #in #unistreet)

#unifacade
(name *) university
(descr *) The univerity, named after Archbishop Markus Sittikus, has been founded in 1622. It will cease to exist in 1810 when the free state of Saalsberg joins the Eastern Empire.
(* is #in #unistreet)

#uni
(name *) university
(room *)
(look *) TBD
(from * go #south to #unistreet)
(from * go #up to #tower)

#tower
(name *) tower
(room *)
(look *) You can see a window. "I am the son of Leopold Wulf. The name is Arthur but everyone calls me Wulferl. I need my violin to perform in your lecture." He is clothed according to the latest fashion, clothing that would eat up all your salary.
(from * go #down to #uni)

#towerwindow
(name *) window
(descr *) Saalsberg lies where the Saalach river leaves the alps and meanders across the state-borders to open out into the Eastern river.
(* is #in #tower)
